  "solution": {
    "text": "Both B and Al can react with nitrogen to form nitride as follows<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br />Boron is not attacked by HCl; while Al reacts with HCl to from <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math> .<br />Both B and Al can react with oxygen to form their oxides.<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />Halides of both <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> are electron deficient molecule, so they act as Lewis acids.",
